OL,3,GNEWSAJoe Lycett pays bar tab at fellow
OL,4,ATraitors star's local
OL,5,
OL,6,FComedian and Celebrity Traitors star
OL,7,FJoe Lycett has announced he is putting
OL,8,F#100 behind the bar of 30 pubs in
OL,9,FEngland so people can "have a drink on
OL,10,Fme".
OL,12,FHe said it was in an effort to support
OL,13,Flocal pubs which were "closing at a
OL,14,Frate of two a day" which he said made
OL,15,Fhim "very sad".
OL,17,FIn Lancashire, he chose the Crown pub
OL,18,Fon Whalley Road in Accrington, after a
OL,19,Frecommendation from his fellow Traitors
OL,20,Fstar Julie Hesmondhalgh.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
